    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summer is hot, but it'd be hotter with a girl!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suki is the cute girl who works at your regular caf\u00e9. You were able to get her contact info... somehow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>What's your first message?</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bored and all alone in the house, exchange messages with her and keep her entertained all summer long. If your texting game is good, maybe you could convince her to meet outside of work. Experience a &quot;slice of life&quot; story set in Kyushu, Japan!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 missions to complete which unlock 16 cute and kawaii poses. All clothing can be removed with free controls to rotate, pan, and zoom in on Suki's body. Completing the game unlocks a bonus 17th and 18th pose!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Before buying, please try out the free demo  to see if Suki turns you on! The demo includes two missions and poses.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: While inspired by real conversations and stories, the game as a whole is a work of fiction.</p>",
